### REST Client request collection for the LR-3 local stack.
### Run from a REST Client extension or copy requests into a terminal.
### Replace tokens/IDs with values returned by the previous response.

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@userToken = PASTE_STUDENT01_ACCESS_TOKEN
@otherUserToken = PASTE_STUDENT02_ACCESS_TOKEN
@adminToken = PASTE_STAFF01_ACCESS_TOKEN
@techToken = PASTE_TECH01_ACCESS_TOKEN
@applicationId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
@documentId = PASTE_ISSUED_DOCUMENT_UUID

### OP-01 Login as USER (copy access_token into @userToken)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "university_id": "student01",
  "password": "Student-Demo-2026!"
}

### Login as second USER (copy access_token into @otherUserToken)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "university_id": "student02",
  "password": "Student-Demo-2026!"
}

### Login as ADMIN (copy access_token into @adminToken)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "university_id": "staff01",
  "password": "Staff-Demo-2026!"
}

### Login as TECH (copy access_token into @techToken)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "university_id": "tech01",
  "password": "Tech-Demo-2026!"
}

### OP-02 Read own application (USER)
GET {{base}}/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### OP-03 Create application (optional Idempotency-Key)
POST {{base}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-user01-create-0001

{
  "document_type_code": "STUDY_CERT",
  "comment": "Запрос справки с места учёбы"
}

### OP-04 Change status (ADMIN; replace applicationId with an owned unit's application)
PATCH {{base}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_review",
  "reason": "Документы приняты в работу"
}

### OP-05 List with optional filters and pagination
GET {{base}}/applications?status=submitted&document_type_code=STUDY_CERT&page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### OP-06 Issue document (ADMIN; application must be approved)
POST {{base}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/issue
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document_title": "Справка с места учёбы"
}

### OP-07 Read document (copy returned document_id into @documentId)
GET {{base}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### OP-08 AI endpoint: must return 501 as allowed by LR-3
POST {{base}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/ai/completeness-check
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### OP-09 Read business audit (ADMIN)
GET {{base}}/audit/events
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Logout (invalidates the currently used token)
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Request recovery code; same generic response for present and absent IDs
POST {{base}}/auth/recovery
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "university_id": "student01"
}

### Confirm recovery; obtain code from local API log, then replace CODE_FROM_LOCAL_LOG
POST {{base}}/auth/recovery/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CODE_FROM_LOCAL_LOG",
  "new_password": "New-Strong-Password-2026!"
}
